 C/HID:,NAME,
C===========================================================
C C/HID / C/DIH - historical runtime save/restore pair (one module,
C two entries; C/DIH is "HID" reversed, matching C/HIDE/C/EDIH).
C C/EVN calls both as SUBP dependencies.
C
C Verbatim port of the Pascal runtime's PASHID/PASDIH
C (paslib/pashid.dtran), renamed for the C libc.  Distinct from
C C/HIDE/C/EDIH (M6..M8 and M13 only).
C===========================================================
                ,ITS ,13
 LOOP1:     9   ,ITS ,6
            9   ,VLM ,LOOP1
           15   ,ATX ,
           14   ,UJ  ,
C===========================================================
 C/DIH:,ENTRY,
C===========================================================
           15   ,XTA ,
           13   ,VTM ,6
 LOOP2:    13   ,UTC ,
                ,STI ,
           13   ,UTM ,-1
            9   ,VLM ,LOOP2
                ,STI ,13
           13   ,UJ  ,
                ,END ,
